{"id":"u-4da301ce-49ca-4ab0-906f-c52756d94e75","src":"community","title":"Musashi Method","author":"Felix Goldhausen","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/4lGvPh-miyamoto-musashi-arc","desc":"Musashi Method is a structured strength and physique system designed to develop controlled, functional power, not just muscle, but the ability to apply force with precision, stability, and intent.\n\nIt combines evidence-based hypertrophy and strength training with a clear structural hierarchy:\n\n- compound lifts for raw force production,\n- isolation work for targeted muscle development,\n- and a dedicated grip system to build real-world control and durability.\n\nEvery element is calibrated to maximize growth while minimizing unnecessary risk, especially for long-term structural health (e.g., reduced spinal loading, controlled movement patterns, and balanced volume distribution).\n\nUnlike traditional bodybuilding programs that prioritize aesthetics alone, or strength programs that chase numbers at the expense of structure, Musashi Method operates in the intersection:\n\n- Muscle that looks dominant\n- Strength that is usable\n- Grip that translates to control over objects, environment, and resistance\n\nTraining frequency, volume, and intensity are aligned with modern research (optimal weekly sets, proximity to failure, progressive overload), but executed with restraint and intent — avoiding wasted volume and systemic fatigue.","level":["Novice","Intermediate","Beginner","Advanced"],"goals":["Muscle","Strength"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":80,"joins":2,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-09-11T04:26:25.306Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["UPPER (HEAVY)","LOWER (HEAVY)","Rest Day","UPPER (VOLUME)","GRIP + FOREARMS","LOWER (VOLUMEN)"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Chest Press (Machine)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":8},{"r":8,"rpe":8.5},{"r":8,"rpe":9}]},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":9,"x":2}]},{"n":"Pull-Up (Bodyweight)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe